#. i18n: file: croppage.ui:26
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIPIPrintImagesPlugin::CropFrame, cropFrame)
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:268
msgid ""
"Move the box in order to crop photos so that they fit inside the photo sizes "
"you have given.  \n"
"You can crop each image differently, or just click the 'Next' button to use "
"the default crop \n"
"setting for each photo.\n"
"Enable \"Do not crop\" to avoid cropping all of the photos."
msgstr ""
"Verschuuv den Kasten, de Fotos warrt denn na Dien angeven Fotogrötten "
"tosneden.\n"
"Du kannst all Biller verscheden tosnieden, oder eenfach op \"Nakamen\" "
"klicken,\n"
"wenn Du för all Fotos de Standard-Tosniedmetood bruken wullt.\n"
"Maak \"Nich tosnieden\" an, wenn Du de Fotos nich tosnieden wullt."

